{'symbol': 'INTU', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'INTUIT INC. PROVIDES EARNINGS GUIDANCE FOR THE FIRST-QUARTER AND FULL-YEAR FISCAL 2020', 'text': 'INTUIT INC. PROVIDED EARNINGS GUIDANCE FOR THE FIRST-QUARTER AND FULL-YEAR FISCAL 2020. FOR THE FIRST QUARTER, THE COMPANY EXPECTS REVENUE OF $1.105 BILLION TO $1.125 BILLION, GROWTH OF 9% TO 11%, OPERATING LOSS OF $40 MILLION TO $50 MILLION AND LOSS PER SHARE OF $0.02 TO $0.04. FOR THE YEAR, THE COMPANY EXPECTS REVENUE OF $7.440 BILLION TO $7.540 BILLION, GROWTH OF 10% TO 11%, OPERATING INCOME OF $2.065 BILLION TO $2.115 BILLION, GROWTH OF 11% TO 14% AND DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE OF $6.35 TO $6.45, GROWTH OF 8% TO 10%.'}